 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["j", "TI"], "-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "245409d3-28a0-4d8b-8e80-180340b6862a"],
 " of every event in the radar domain, with its time and distance marginals, \
